<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 font-sans p-8">
<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg p-8">
  <header class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start md:justify-between mb-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800">Jouw Naam</h1>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-blue-600 font-medium">Full-stack Web Developer</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 text-sm text-gray-600">
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> jouw@email.com</p>
      <p><strong>Telefoon:</strong> +31 6 12345678</p>
      <p><strong>Locatie:</strong> Amsterdam, NL</p>
      <p><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> linkedin.com/in/jouwnaam</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1 mb-2">Profiel</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-700">
      Enthousiaste en resultaatgerichte ontwikkelaar met 3+ jaar ervaring in moderne webtechnologieën zoals Laravel, React en Tailwind. Sterk in het vertalen van complexe wensen naar gebruiksvriendelijke oplossingen.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1 mb-2">Werkervaring</h3>
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold">Full-stack Developer – Webbedrijf BV</h4>
      <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">Jan 2022 – heden | Utrecht</span>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mt-2">
        <li>Ontwikkeling van maatwerk Laravel-modules voor klantenportalen</li>
        <li>Realtime chatfunctie gebouwd met Livewire & Laravel WebSockets</li>
        <li>Beheer van CI/CD pipelines met GitHub Actions en Forge</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1 mb-2">Opleiding</h3>
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold">HBO Informatica – Hogeschool Utrecht</h4>
      <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">2017 – 2021</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1 mb-2">Vaardigheden</h3>
    <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm text-white">
      <li class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Laravel</li>
      <li class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Vue.js</li>
      <li class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tailwind CSS</li>
      <li class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">MySQL</li>
      <li class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Git</li>
      <li class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Docker</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1 mb-2">Talen</h3>
    <ul class="text-gray-700">
      <li><strong>Nederlands:</strong> Moedertaal</li>
      <li><strong>Engels:</strong> Vloeiend</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
